        ("07.1", "menu-states", "Menu, states sheet (F13)", "every ⋯, More and the user menu", "Rest, hover, keyboard focus, a destructive item hovered, disabled with its reason, with descriptions, flipped up, and the phone bottom sheet."),
        ("07.2", "action-group-states", "Action group, states sheet (F14)", "every title row", "One primary action plus More: rest, More open, a destructive item hovered, the split button with variants, and the phone sheet."),
